    "M007\nm010\n\nm1\n"
   ],
   "expected": "previous visits: 0\nignored: X9\nthis run: 2, total: 2\nlast: M001, M002\n===== RESTART: session 2 (same folder, files kept) =====\nprevious visits: 2\nignored: M1\nthis run: 2, total: 4\nlast: M002, M007, M010\n"
